<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1F">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "06">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1626017" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Water Inlet Pipe Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1626001">Cooling System Components:K14D</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1626017001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intake manifold. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426021"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect the following hoses and clamp from water inlet pipe (1).
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Radiator outlet hose (2)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
EGR cooler outlet hose No.2 (3)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Heater outlet hose No.2 (4)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clamps (5)
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162009.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.958mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162010.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.043mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove water inlet pipe bolts (1) from water inlet pipe.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.043mm" ver = "01" gw = "187" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove water inlet pipe (1) with O-ring (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162012.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.873mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1626017002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new O-ring (1).
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Apply coolant to O-ring and insert water inlet pipe (2) all the way into cylinder block.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162013.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.873mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If there is matchmark on each of hose and pipe, install the hose aligning matchmark on hose with matchmark on pipe and then install each clamp in proper position.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Refill cooling system with coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check cooling system for leakage. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
